From c1190608cef9279de6fb39c4dd028c18e3b2e25c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 02:44:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/31] Add the Fairy type

- TYPE_FAIRY with Gen 6 matchups; Steel no longer resists Ghost or Dark
- 18 Gen 1-3 Pokemon get their modern Fairy typing; Charm, Sweet Kiss and
  Moonlight become Fairy-type
- New moves: Fairy Wind, Disarming Voice, Draining Kiss (heals 3/4),
  Dazzling Gleam, Play Rough and Moonblast, with animations built from
  existing effects, added to modern level-up learnsets and egg moves
- FAIRY type icon; Hidden Power still never rolls Fairy
- Lance's Dragons carry Iron Tail
- Guide: Fairy in the type chart and Pokedex, original types noted

Generated by tools/hack/fairy.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
